#: src/introduction.md:32
msgid "A note on output"
msgstr "Napomena o izlazu"

#: src/introduction.md:34
msgid ""
"goat is built to be both a pleasure to use _and_ safe to script. Friendly "
"touches — a 🐐 when everything's green, a hint about your next step — only "
"ever appear on an interactive terminal. Pipe goat into a script or ask for "
"`--json` and you get clean, stable, machine-readable output with nothing "
"decorative in the way. Set `GOAT_NO_FUN=1` and even the interactive "
"flourishes go quiet."
msgstr ""
"goat je napravljen da bude i ugodan za korišćenje _i_ bezbjedan za "
"skriptovanje. Prijateljski detalji — 🐐 kad je sve zeleno, savjet o vašem "
"narednom koraku — pojavljuju se samo na interaktivnom terminalu. "
"Proslijedite goat u skriptu ili tražite `--json` i dobijate čist, stabilan, "
"mašinski čitljiv izlaz bez ičega dekorativnog na putu. Postavite "
"`GOAT_NO_FUN=1` i čak i interaktivni ukrasi utihnu."

#: src/getting-started.md:3
msgid ""
"You don't need a profile, a bundle, or a network to start. goat ships with a "
"sandbox so you can learn by doing, safely."
msgstr ""
"Ne treba vam profil, bundle ni mreža da biste počeli. goat dolazi sa "
"sandboxom kako biste mogli učiti kroz praksu, bezbjedno."

#: src/getting-started.md:5
msgid "1. Say hello"
msgstr "1. Pozdravite"

#: src/getting-started.md:11
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"◇ SANDBOX — simulated fabric, no real mesh. Run `goat init` to attach a real "
"env.\n"
"goat hello — saying `lo` to the fabric as `default` on topic `hello/"
"default`\n"
"  [t+  42ms] portal     accepted topic `hello/default` (simulated)\n"
"  [t+  74ms] fabric     routed `lo` to `hello/default` over the WireGuard "
"P2P path (simulated)\n"
"  [t+ 101ms] subscriber your subscriber received `lo` — round-trip complete "
"(simulated)\n"
"  └─ `lo`: the first message ever sent over a network (ARPANET, 29 Oct 1969) "
"— they typed \"LOGIN\" and the link crashed after two letters.\n"
"round-trip complete.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"◇ SANDBOX — simulirani fabric, bez prave mreže. Pokrenite `goat init` da "
"povežete pravo okruženje.\n"
"goat hello — govori `lo` fabricu kao `default` na temi `hello/default`\n"
"  [t+  42ms] portal     prihvatio temu `hello/default` (simulirano)\n"
"  [t+  74ms] fabric     usmjerio `lo` na `hello/default` preko WireGuard P2P "
"putanje (simulirano)\n"
"  [t+ 101ms] subscriber vaš pretplatnik primio `lo` — povratni put završen "
"(simulirano)\n"
"  └─ `lo`: prva poruka ikad poslata preko mreže (ARPANET, 29. okt 1969) — "
"kucali su \"LOGIN\" i veza je pala poslije dva slova.\n"
"povratni put završen.\n"
"```"

#: src/getting-started.md:21
msgid ""
"`goat hello` publishes a message, subscribes to it, and watches it come back "
"— narrating every hop the data took. In the sandbox those hops are "
"simulated; against a real env they're real. Either way, when it says _round-"
"trip complete_, you know the path works end to end."
msgstr ""
"`goat hello` objavljuje poruku, pretplaćuje se na nju i posmatra kako se "
"vraća — pripovijedajući svaki skok koji su podaci napravili. U sandboxu su "
"ti skokovi simulirani; naspram pravog okruženja oni su stvarni. U svakom "
"slučaju, kad kaže _povratni put završen_, znate da putanja radi s kraja na "
"kraj."

#: src/getting-started.md:23
msgid ""
"The message is `lo` on purpose — the first thing ever sent over a network."
msgstr "Poruka je `lo` namjerno — prva stvar ikad poslata preko mreže."

#: src/getting-started.md:25
msgid "2. Take the tour"
msgstr "2. Krenite u obilazak"

#: src/getting-started.md:31
msgid ""
"`goat tutor` is a self-paced, hands-on tour — think `vimtutor` for the "
"fabric. Eight short lessons take you from \"what is this\" to publishing, "
"subscribing, diagnosing, and reading the substrate cascade. It runs in the "
"sandbox by default, saves your place, and you can stop and resume any time:"
msgstr ""
"`goat tutor` je praktičan obilazak vlastitim tempom — zamislite `vimtutor` "
"za fabric. Osam kratkih lekcija vode vas od \"šta je ovo\" do objavljivanja, "
"pretplaćivanja, dijagnostikovanja i čitanja kaskade substrata. "
"Podrazumijevano se izvršava u sandboxu, čuva vašu poziciju, a možete "
"prekinuti i nastaviti u bilo koje vrijeme:"

#: src/getting-started.md:39
msgid "3. Attach a real environment"
msgstr "3. Povežite pravo okruženje"

#: src/getting-started.md:41
msgid ""
"When you've been issued an onboarding **bundle** (a `.cbor` file with your "
"identity), the wizard takes it from here:"
msgstr ""
"Kad vam je izdat **bundle** za uvođenje (`.cbor` fajl sa vašim identitetom), "
"čarobnjak preuzima dalje:"

#: src/getting-started.md:49
msgid ""
"`goat init` is the friendly front door — it detects whether you're set up, "
"lets you choose the sandbox or a real env, proves it works, and points you "
"at the tutor. `goat doctor` then runs a stepped reachability check (mesh → "
"router → certificate → portal) and, if anything's wrong, tells you exactly "
"what to fix."
msgstr ""
"`goat init` su prijateljska ulazna vrata — otkriva da li ste podešeni, "
"omogućava vam da izaberete sandbox ili pravo okruženje, dokazuje da radi i "
"upućuje vas na tutor. `goat doctor` zatim pokreće stepenastu provjeru "
"dostupnosti (mesh → router → certifikat → portal) i, ako nešto nije u redu, "
"kaže vam tačno šta da popravite."

#: src/getting-started.md:51
msgid ""
"When all of doctor's steps pass, you'll see a small 🐐 — you're on the "
"fabric."
msgstr "Kad svi koraci doctor-a prođu, vidjećete malu 🐐 — na fabricu ste."

#: src/getting-started.md:53
msgid "Where to next"
msgstr "Kuda dalje"

#: src/getting-started.md:55
msgid "New to the ideas? Read **[How the fabric works](concepts.md)**."
msgstr ""
"Novi ste u ovim idejama? Pročitajte **[Kako fabric funkcioniše]"
"(concepts.md)**."

#: src/getting-started.md:56
msgid "Ready to do things? Jump to **[Everyday tasks](everyday.md)**."
msgstr ""
"Spremni da nešto uradite? Skočite na **[Svakodnevni zadaci](everyday.md)**."

#: src/getting-started.md:57
msgid "Something not working? **[Troubleshooting](troubleshooting.md)**."
msgstr "Nešto ne radi? **[Rješavanje problema](troubleshooting.md)**."

#: src/concepts.md:3
msgid ""
"You can use goat productively with just three ideas: **identity**, "
"**topics**, and **no broker**. Here they are."
msgstr ""
"goat možete koristiti produktivno sa samo tri ideje: **identitet**, **teme** "
"i **nema brokera**. Evo ih."

#: src/concepts.md:5
msgid "A mesh you join with an identity"
msgstr "Mesh kome se pridružujete identitetom"

#: src/concepts.md:7
msgid ""
"The fabric is a self-healing mesh. Peers connect **directly** to each other "
"over encrypted WireGuard tunnels — once you're enrolled, your data doesn't "
"route through a central server, and your connections survive a management-"
"plane outage or a flaky uplink."
msgstr ""
"Fabric je samoizlječivi mesh. Učesnici se povezuju **direktno** jedni s "
"drugima preko šifrovanih WireGuard tunela — kad se jednom uključite, vaši "
"podaci ne prolaze kroz centralni server, a vaše veze prežive ispad "
"upravljačke ravni ili nestabilan uplink."

#: src/concepts.md:9
msgid ""
"You join with an **identity**: an onboarding _bundle_ that carries your "
"certificate, an access token, and where the fabric lives. The fabric admits "
"you by _who you are_, not by a shared password. `goat profile init "
"<bundle.cbor>` installs that identity; you can hold several under different "
"_contexts_ and switch between them."
msgstr ""
"Pridružujete se sa **identitetom**: _bundle_ za uvođenje koji nosi vaš "
"certifikat, pristupni token i lokaciju gdje fabric živi. Fabric vas prima po "
"tome _ko ste_, a ne po dijeljenoj lozinki. `goat profile init <bundle.cbor>` "
"instalira taj identitet; možete držati više njih pod različitim "
"_kontekstima_ i prebacivati se između njih."

#: src/concepts.md:19
msgid "Topics: publish and subscribe"
msgstr "Teme: objavljivanje i pretplata"

#: src/concepts.md:21
msgid ""
"Data moves on **topics** — slash-delimited paths like `acme/radar1/tracks`. "
"The model is publish/subscribe:"
msgstr ""
"Podaci se kreću po **temama** — putanjama razdvojenim kosom crtom kao `acme/"
"radar1/tracks`. Model je publish/subscribe:"

#: src/concepts.md:23
msgid "**Publish** (`goat pub <topic> <payload>`) writes a value to a topic."
msgstr "**Publish** (`goat pub <topic> <payload>`) upisuje vrijednost u temu."

#: src/concepts.md:24
msgid ""
"**Subscribe** (`goat sub <topic>`) receives every value published there, "
"live, as long as you're allowed to read it."
msgstr ""
"**Subscribe** (`goat sub <topic>`) prima svaku vrijednost objavljenu tamo, "
"uživo, dok god imate dozvolu da je čitate."

#: src/concepts.md:26
msgid ""
"A topic is just a name; you create it (`goat topic create`), publish to it, "
"and anyone permitted can subscribe. `goat hello` is simply a publish and a "
"subscribe wired together so you can watch a value make the round trip."
msgstr ""
"Tema je samo ime; kreirate je (`goat topic create`), objavljujete na nju, a "
"svako ko ima dozvolu može se pretplatiti. `goat hello` je jednostavno "
"publish i subscribe spojeni zajedno kako biste mogli posmatrati kako "
"vrijednost pravi povratni put."

#: src/concepts.md:28
msgid "No broker — and why that matters"
msgstr "Nema brokera — i zašto je to važno"

#: src/concepts.md:30
msgid ""
"There is **no central broker** sitting in the middle of the data path. When "
"you publish, the value flows over the mesh directly to the peers subscribed "
"to it. That's deliberate: it removes the single bottleneck and single point "
"of failure that a broker would be."
msgstr ""
"Ne postoji **centralni broker** koji sjedi u sredini putanje podataka. Kad "
"objavite, vrijednost teče preko mesha direktno do učesnika koji su na nju "
"pretplaćeni. To je namjerno: uklanja jedinstveno usko grlo i jedinstvenu "
"tačku otkaza koja bi broker bio."

#: src/concepts.md:32
msgid ""
"A practical consequence: **reads are broad, writes are the cut.** Being able "
"to _read_ a topic is permissive by design; _writing_ to one is governed by "
"your identity. So you'll rarely be surprised by what you can subscribe to, "
"and the integrity of what's published is anchored to who published it."
msgstr ""
"Praktična posljedica: **čitanja su široka, upisi su rez.** Mogućnost da se "
"tema _čita_ je dozvoljiva po dizajnu; _upisivanje_ u nju je uređeno vašim "
"identitetom. Tako da ćete rijetko biti iznenađeni onim na šta se možete "
"pretplatiti, a integritet onoga što je objavljeno usidren je za onoga ko ga "
"je objavio."

#: src/concepts.md:34
msgid "Sandbox vs. real"
msgstr "Sandbox naspram pravog"

#: src/concepts.md:36
msgid ""
"Everything above has a faithful **in-process simulation** — the sandbox. "
"`goat hello --sandbox`, `goat init --sandbox`, and `goat tutor` exercise the "
"same shapes (a topic, a publish, a round-trip, a verdict) with no network "
"and no identity, so you can learn the model before you touch the real "
"fabric. The sandbox always says so with a `◇ SANDBOX` banner, and it never "
"writes to or reads from a real mesh."
msgstr ""
"Sve gore navedeno ima vjernu **simulaciju unutar procesa** — sandbox. `goat "
"hello --sandbox`, `goat init --sandbox` i `goat tutor` vježbaju iste oblike "
"(tema, objava, povratni put, presuda) bez mreže i bez identiteta, tako da "
"možete naučiti model prije nego što dodirnete pravi fabric. Sandbox to "
"uvijek govori `◇ SANDBOX` banerom i nikad ne upisuje u niti čita iz pravog "
"mesha."

#: src/concepts.md:38
msgid ""
"When you switch to a real env, the _commands don't change_ — only the "
"backing does."
msgstr ""
"Kad pređete na pravo okruženje, _komande se ne mijenjaju_ — mijenja se samo "
"ono što stoji iza njih."

#: src/concepts.md:40
msgid ""
"Want the deeper architecture (the relay fallback, the access model, the "
"audit trail)? Ask your goat administrator for the design references — this "
"guide stays focused on operating the CLI."
msgstr ""
"Želite dublju arhitekturu (relejni fallback, model pristupa, revizioni "
"trag)? Pitajte svog goat administratora za projektne reference — ovaj vodič "
"ostaje fokusiran na rad sa CLI-jem."

#: src/everyday.md:3
msgid ""
"The commands you'll actually reach for, as quick recipes. Add `--help` to "
"any of them for the full set of flags, or see the **[Command reference]"
"(reference.md)**."
msgstr ""
"Komande za kojima ćete zaista posezati, kao brzi recepti. Dodajte `--help` "
"na bilo koju od njih za potpuni skup flagova, ili pogledajte **[Referenca "
"komandi](reference.md)**."

#: src/everyday.md:5
msgid "Check you're connected"
msgstr "Provjerite da li ste povezani"

#: src/everyday.md:12
msgid ""
"`goat doctor` is your first stop whenever something feels off — each step "
"that fails prints a specific remediation. When everything's green, both "
"commands give you a clear all-clear."
msgstr ""
"`goat doctor` je vaša prva stanica kad god nešto ne valja — svaki korak koji "
"ne uspije ispisuje konkretan način otklanjanja. Kad je sve zeleno, obje "
"komande vam daju jasan znak da je sve u redu."

#: src/everyday.md:14
msgid "Publish and subscribe"
msgstr "Objavljivanje i pretplata"

#: src/everyday.md:16
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"goat sub 'acme/radar1/tracks'             # watch a topic live (Ctrl-C to "
"stop)\n"
"goat sub 'acme/**'                        # a whole subtree\n"
"goat pub acme/radar1/tracks '{\"t\":1}'     # publish a payload\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"goat sub 'acme/radar1/tracks'             # posmatrajte temu uživo (Ctrl-C "
"za prekid)\n"
"goat sub 'acme/**'                        # cijelo podstablo\n"
"goat pub acme/radar1/tracks '{\"t\":1}'     # objavite payload\n"
"```"

#: src/everyday.md:22
msgid "Want to see the ripple a publish sets off? Add `--narrate`:"
msgstr "Želite vidjeti talasanje koje objava izazove? Dodajte `--narrate`:"

#: src/everyday.md:24
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"goat pub acme/radar1/tracks '{\"t\":1}' --narrate\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"goat pub acme/radar1/tracks '{\"t\":1}' --narrate\n"
"```"

#: src/everyday.md:28
msgid "Work with topics"
msgstr "Rad sa temama"

#: src/everyday.md:30
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"goat topic ls                              # list topics\n"
"goat topic ls acme                         # drill into an org/prefix\n"
"goat topic show acme/radar1/tracks         # one topic's full record\n"
"goat topic create acme/radar1/tracks --format protobuf:Track --description "
"\"live tracks\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"goat topic ls                              # izlistaj teme\n"
"goat topic ls acme                         # uđi u organizaciju/prefiks\n"
"goat topic show acme/radar1/tracks         # potpun zapis jedne teme\n"
"goat topic create acme/radar1/tracks --format protobuf:Track --description "
"\"live tracks\"\n"
"```"

#: src/everyday.md:37
msgid ""
"After you create a topic, goat nudges you toward the natural next step "
"(watch it, or publish to it)."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što kreirate temu, goat vas usmjerava ka prirodnom narednom koraku "
"(posmatrajte je ili objavite na nju)."

#: src/everyday.md:39
msgid "Diagnose a problem"
msgstr "Dijagnostikujte problem"

#: src/everyday.md:47
msgid ""
"`inspect` returns findings and the remedy for each — what's wrong and what "
"to do about it."
msgstr ""
"`inspect` vraća nalaze i rješenje za svaki — šta nije u redu i šta da se "
"uradi povodom toga."

#: src/everyday.md:49
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Skriptovanje"

#: src/everyday.md:51
msgid ""
"Every command that prints a human view also offers `--json` for a stable, "
"machine-readable one. The JSON form never carries banners, hints, or "
"flourishes, and its shape and your exit code stay constant across releases "
"and languages:"
msgstr ""
"Svaka komanda koja ispisuje ljudski pregled nudi i `--json` za stabilan, "
"mašinski čitljiv. JSON oblik nikad ne nosi banere, savjete ni ukrase, a "
"njegov oblik i vaš izlazni kod ostaju nepromijenjeni kroz izdanja i jezike:"

#: src/everyday.md:58
msgid "This is the contract: **friendly on a terminal, clean in a pipe.**"
msgstr "Ovo je ugovor: **prijateljski na terminalu, čist u pipe-u.**"

#: src/everyday.md:60
msgid ""
"One caution: `goat status` opens a real session at the router each time it runs, so it is a check you run when you want an answer, not something to poll from a timer. For a trend over time use `goat health` or `goat top`, which read what the goatnet already publishes."
msgstr ""
"Jedno upozorenje: `goat status` pri svakom pokretanju otvara stvarnu sesiju prema ruteru, pa je to provjera koju pokrećete kad želite odgovor, a ne nešto što se poziva iz tajmera. Za trend kroz vrijeme koristite `goat health` ili `goat top`, koji čitaju ono što goatnet već objavljuje."

#: src/install.md:3
msgid ""
"goat is a single self-contained binary — no runtime, no dependencies. It's "
"served mesh-internally from `get.<your-goatnet>` (you're already on the mesh "
"if you can read this), and the version here always matches the binary that "
"surface serves."
msgstr ""
"goat je jedan samostalan binarni fajl — bez runtime-a, bez zavisnosti. "
"Poslužuje se interno na mreži sa `get.<your-goatnet>` (već ste na meshu ako "
"ovo možete da pročitate), a verzija ovdje uvijek odgovara binarnom fajlu "
"koji ta površina poslužuje."

#: src/install.md:5
msgid "Quick install"
msgstr "Brza instalacija"

#: src/install.md:7
msgid "**macOS / Linux**"
msgstr "**macOS / Linux**"

#: src/install.md:10
msgid ""
"$(uname -s | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]')              # darwin | linux\n"
msgstr ""
"$(uname -s | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]')              # darwin | linux\n"

#: src/install.md:11
msgid "$(uname -m | sed 's/x86_64/amd64/;s/aarch64/arm64/')  # amd64 | arm64\n"
msgstr ""
"$(uname -m | sed 's/x86_64/amd64/;s/aarch64/arm64/')  # amd64 | arm64\n"

#: src/install.md:12
msgid "\"https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-${OS}-${ARCH}\""
msgstr "\"https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-${OS}-${ARCH}\""

#: src/install.md:17
msgid "Make sure `~/.local/bin` is on your `PATH`."
msgstr "Provjerite da je `~/.local/bin` u vašem `PATH`-u."

#: src/install.md:19
msgid "**Windows (PowerShell)**"
msgstr "**Windows (PowerShell)**"

#: src/install.md:21
msgid ""
"```powershell\n"
"iwr \"https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-windows-amd64.exe\" -OutFile "
"\"$env:USERPROFILE\\goat.exe\"\n"
"& \"$env:USERPROFILE\\goat.exe\" --version\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```powershell\n"
"iwr \"https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-windows-amd64.exe\" -OutFile "
"\"$env:USERPROFILE\\goat.exe\"\n"
"& \"$env:USERPROFILE\\goat.exe\" --version\n"
"```"

#: src/install.md:26
msgid ""
"Every subcommand works on Windows except `goat client` (the local tunnel "
"daemon), which is Linux/macOS-only."
msgstr ""
"Svaka podkomanda radi na Windows-u osim `goat client` (lokalni tunelski "
"daemon), koji je samo za Linux/macOS."

#: src/install.md:28
msgid "Verify the download (recommended)"
msgstr "Provjerite preuzimanje (preporučeno)"

#: src/install.md:30
msgid ""
"The download surface publishes a per-binary `*.sha256` and an aggregate "
"`SHA256SUMS`. For a high-assurance install, verify before you run:"
msgstr ""
"Površina za preuzimanje objavljuje `*.sha256` po binarnom fajlu i zbirni "
"`SHA256SUMS`. Za instalaciju visoke pouzdanosti, provjerite prije pokretanja:"

#: src/install.md:33
msgid "\"https://get.<your-goatnet>\""
msgstr "\"https://get.<your-goatnet>\""

#: src/install.md:34
msgid "\"$BASE/SHA256SUMS\""
msgstr "\"$BASE/SHA256SUMS\""

#: src/install.md:35
msgid "\"$BASE/goat-${OS}-${ARCH}\""
msgstr "\"$BASE/goat-${OS}-${ARCH}\""

#: src/install.md:35
msgid "# macOS: shasum -a 256 -c   ·   Linux: sha256sum -c\n"
msgstr "# macOS: shasum -a 256 -c   ·   Linux: sha256sum -c\n"

#: src/install.md:41
msgid "Platforms"
msgstr "Platforme"

#: src/install.md:43
msgid "OS"
msgstr "OS"

#: src/install.md:43
msgid "Architectures"
msgstr "Arhitekture"

#: src/install.md:45
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: src/install.md:45
msgid "`amd64`, `arm64`"
msgstr "`amd64`, `arm64`"

#: src/install.md:46
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: src/install.md:46
msgid "`amd64` (Intel), `arm64` (Apple Silicon)"
msgstr "`amd64` (Intel), `arm64` (Apple Silicon)"

#: src/install.md:47
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: src/install.md:47
msgid "`amd64`"
msgstr "`amd64`"

#: src/install.md:49
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Ažuriranje"

#: src/install.md:51
msgid ""
"Re-run the install one-liner — it always fetches the version this site is "
"serving. To confirm what you have, `goat --version`."
msgstr ""
"Ponovo pokrenite instalacionu jednolinijsku komandu — ona uvijek dohvata "
"verziju koju ovaj sajt poslužuje. Da potvrdite šta imate, `goat --version`."

#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat govori vaš jezik. Njegov tekst namijenjen ljudima — greške, ispisi "
"`doctor` i `status`, ekrani `--help` — preveden je na **svih 28 jezika "
"članica NATO-a plus ukrajinski**."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Izbor jezika"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat bira jezik ovim redoslijedom:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "flag `--lang` (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "promjenljiva okruženja `GOAT_LANG` (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "lokalizacija vašeg operativnog sistema,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "engleski."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# samo ova komanda, na njemačkom\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# sve, na francuskom, za ovaj shell\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Engleski je mjerodavni izvor: ako fraza još nije prevedena, goat prikazuje "
"engleski umjesto praznine."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Šta ostaje isto na svakom jeziku"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"**Mašinska površina se nikad ne mijenja**. Vrijednosti polja `--json`, "
"kodovi grešaka (`E_OFF_MESH`, …), izlazni kodovi, imena komandi i flagova i "
"ugovorni tokeni (putanje, ključevi, URL-ovi) identični su bajt po bajt bez "
"obzira na jezik. Prevodi se proza, ne ugovor — tako da vaše skripte rade "
"isto za svakog operatera."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "Napomena o mašinski prevedenom tekstu"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"Većina prijevoda je mašinski proizvedena i čeka pregled izvornog govornika. "
"Kad pokrenete goat na jednom od tih jezika, ispisuje kratko, jednokratno "
"obavještenje na standardnu grešku koje vam govori da je tekst mašinski "
"preveden, da je engleski mjerodavan i gdje prijaviti grešku u prijevodu. "
"Potisnite ga sa `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Ako govorite jedan od ovih jezika i primijetite nešto neispravno, takva "
"prijava je iskreno dobrodošla — tako se katalozi poboljšavaju."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "I jedan iz zabave"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` prikazuje istaknute linije na **klingonskom**. To je "
"opciono uskršnje jaje — nikad se ne bira automatski — i, kao i svaka druga "
"lokalizacija, ne može dodirnuti mašinsku površinu. Qapla'."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "When something's wrong, start with one command:"
msgstr "Kad nešto nije u redu, počnite jednom komandom:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid ""
"It runs four steps in order and, for any that fails, prints a specific fix. "
"Here's how to read it."
msgstr ""
"Pokreće četiri koraka redom i, za svaki koji ne uspije, ispisuje konkretnu "
"popravku. Evo kako da to čitate."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "Reading `goat doctor`"
msgstr "Čitanje `goat doctor`"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Korak"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "Šta provjerava"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Ako ne uspije"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mesh**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Na mreži fabrica ste"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr ""
"Niste na meshu — podignite svoj tunel (`netbird status` / ponovo se "
"uključite)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**router**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "Router fabrica je dostupan"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"Router je možda van funkcije, ili je vaš endpoint pogrešan — ponovo "
"provjerite svoj profil"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**certifikat**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Vaš identitet je prihvaćen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Vaš certifikat je možda istekao ili odbijen — `goat profile show`, pa se "
"ponovo uključite ako je potrebno"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "**portal**"
msgstr "**portal**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Your access token works"
msgstr "Vaš pristupni token radi"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Token expired or revoked — ask to be re-onboarded"
msgstr "Token je istekao ili opozvan — zatražite ponovno uključivanje"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"Svaki neuspjeli korak izlazi sa zasebnim kodom, tako da omotač-skripta može "
"granati bez parsiranja teksta."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Uobičajene situacije"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Niste na mreži fabrica. "
"Podignite svoj mesh tunel i pokušajte ponovo; `goat doctor` će potvrditi kad "
"budete povezani."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Vaš identitet je "
"zastario. `goat profile show` da vidite njegov rok važenja; ako je prošao, "
"trebaće vam novi bundle."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Vaš pristupni token više nije "
"važeći (istekao ili opozvan). Zatražite od svog administratora da vas ponovo "
"uključi."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` prikazuje `[✗]`** `status` je pregled na prvi pogled; "
"pokrenite `goat doctor` za stepenasti detalj i konkretno rješenje."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` prikazuje `ztol` zeleno, ali `session` crveno** Port rutera prihvata veze, ali se Zenoh sesija ne otvara: ruter je zaglavljen ili odbija vaš sertifikat. Ponovno pokretanje mesh veze to ne rješava. Pokrenite `goat doctor` i obavijestite administratora."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "Razumijevanje koda greške"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr "Svaka greška nosi stabilan kod (kao `E_OFF_MESH`). Da ga potražite:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Vježbajte bez rizika"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Ako samo želite istraživati komande bez dodirivanja bilo čega stvarnog, "
"sandbox je uvijek tu:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "I dalje zaglavljeni?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Zabilježite tačnu komandu i njen izlaz (koristite `--json` za čist, potpun "
"zapis) i odnesite to svom goat administratoru."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` je operaterska površina: ukrcavanje i ukidanje učesnika, "
"rotacija certifikata, isključivanje problematičnog pira s mreže, "
"provizioniranje uređaja i LAN-dijagnostika. Namjerno je odvojena od "
"svakodnevnih komandi."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Samo za operatere.** Ove komande su namijenjene operaterima koji posjeduju "
"admin akreditive. Ako ste učesnik koji objavljuje i pretplaćuje se na "
"fabric, ovo poglavlje nije vaša svakodnevica — vaša površina je "
"**[Svakodnevni zadaci](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / "
"`health`). `goat admin` je **inertna za ne-admine**: neovlašćen poziv ne "
"mijenja ništa i obavještava vas o tome."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Šta \"samo za operatere\" znači u praksi"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"Ovlaštenje nije u CLI-ju — ono je u _vašim akreditivima_. `goat` je tanak "
"klijent; to da li smijete ukrcati organizaciju ili izbaciti pira određuje "
"vaš operaterski profil i okruženje, a potvrđuje portal i NetBird management "
"API. Zato admin komanda može stati na dva legitimna mjesta:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**Na početku, prije nego što se išta pošalje.** Ako vaša mašina nema nikakvo "
"operatersko podešavanje — ni inicijalizovani profil ni operatersko okruženje "
"— `goat admin` odmah odbija s `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Ništa ne napušta vaš laptop."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Na strani servera, pri akciji.** Ako imate akreditive ali nisu ovlašćeni "
"za ovu akciju, portal ili NetBird vraća odbijanje. Odbijeno _mutiranje_ "
"znači da se ništa nije promijenilo — a `goat` to prijavljuje kao "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, ne kao nejasan grešku tokena."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "Dva koda greške koja treba razlikovati:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kod"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Značenje"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Šta uraditi"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Vaš akreditiv je **validan ali nije ovlašćen** za ovu akciju (ili nije "
"konfigurisan nijedan operaterski akreditiv)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite da li koristite operaterski profil i da li ste učitali "
"operatersko okruženje. Ako i dalje ne možete, ova akcija nije za vašu ulogu "
"— kontaktirajte svog goat administratora. Ponovno ukrcavanje neće to "
"promijeniti."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Vaš akreditiv je **istekao ili je neispravan** (HTTP 401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Ponovo se ukrcajte da biste dobili svjež token."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Čitanje o adminu nikad nije ograničeno: `goat admin --help` i `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` uvijek rade, na svakom jeziku. Samo _pokretanje_ akcije se "
"provjerava."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "Komande"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--help` bilo kojoj od ovih za pun skup zastavica, ili pogledajte "
"**[Referenca komandi](reference.md)** — detalji tamo se generišu iz binarnog "
"fajla, pa uvijek odgovaraju onome što pokrećete."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "Nekoliko napomena:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` je dijagnostika za hitne slučajeve.** `scan` i `doctor` ništa ne "
"mutiraju, ne zahtijevaju akreditive i napravljeni su da rade kada su mreža i "
"svi servisi nedostupni — tako da su jedini dio `goat admin` koji se ne "
"odbija zbog nedostajućeg operaterskog okruženja."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` zadržava identitet nepromijenjenim.** Ponovo izdaje lisni "
"certifikat za isti anchor, alias, write namespace i ACL — samo su cert i "
"ključ novi. Koristite ga za obnovu ili promjenu ključeva, ne za mijenjanje "
"nečijeg identiteta."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` je pravo isključivanje.** Na fabric-u bez brokera certifikat je "
"inertан bez mrežne putanje, pa je uklanjanje _pira_ ono što zaustavlja "
"floodera — `goat health` ga pronalazi, `goat admin peer cut` ga izbacuje."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Destruktivne akcije prvo traže potvrdu.** `org delete`, `peer cut` i `--"
"org` kaskade ispisuju šta namjeravaju uraditi i pitaju prije djelovanja (`--"
"yes` za preskakanje, `--dry-run` za pregled)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Ako vidite `E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Ništa nije promijenjeno. Provjerite korak po korak:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Da li koristite operaterski profil?** `goat context use <name>` ga bira; "
"`goat profile show` potvrđuje koji je aktivan."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Da li ste učitali operatersko okruženje?** Admin akcije čitaju operaterske "
"akreditive iz okruženja (na primjer `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` i NetBird admin "
"token) — nikad iz profila na disku."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Da li uopšte treba da imate ovaj pristup?** Ako ste provjerili gore "
"navedeno i portal i dalje odbija, vaša uloga nije ovlašćena za ovu akciju. "
"Kontaktirajte svog goat administratora — ponovno ukrcavanje istog identiteta "
"to neće odobriti."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Cjeloviti operaterski tok rada"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje vam daje pregled površine i njenog ponašanja. Cjeloviti "
"operaterski tok rada — model sposobnosti, podešavanje okruženja i "
"certifikata, te petlja ukrcavanja / opoziva / rotacije / revizije — nalazi "
"se u **vodiču za admin-operatere** koji se isporučuje s operativnom "
"dokumentacijom vaše goatnet mreže, a ne u ovoj knjizi."

